---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Prashant Shah" bg="home">
  <section class="hero reveal">
    <h1 transition:name="page-title">
      I build software that closes the gap between what systems know and what people need.
    </h1>
    <p class="context">
      CS &amp; Data Science at Ramapo College, graduating May 2026. Currently finishing my capstone and looking for full-time roles.
    </p>

    <div class="ctas">
      <a href="mailto:shahp0021@gmail.com" class="btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
      <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn-ghost">Resume</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="work-panel reveal" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">
    <h2 class="section-label">Selected Work</h2>

    <a href="/work#canvas-agent" class="card glass glass-hover">
      <h3>Canvas Agent</h3>
      <p>I wanted an AI agent that could handle my LMS for me. So I built one. Nine tools, persistent memory, a planner that knows what's due before I ask.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/work#trimble" class="card glass glass-hover">
      <h3>Trimble</h3>
      <p>Configuration across a distributed broker architecture had no single source of truth. I built the platform that gave engineers one place to see everything.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/research" class="card glass glass-hover">
      <h3>The Research</h3>
      <p>What happens when someone asks for a happy movie about war? Retrieval systems break. I'm studying why, and building a framework to fix it.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/work#pantry" class="card glass glass-hover">
      <h3>Center for Food Action</h3>
      <p>Volunteers log donated food one-handed while carrying boxes. The old system didn't account for that. The new one does.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <p class="currently reveal" style="animation-delay: 0.35s">
    <a href="/now">See what I'm working on right now &rarr;</a>
  </p>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 70vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4.5vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 540px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .context {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 420px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #09090f;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #09090f;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 150ms ease;
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .work-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-faint);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .card {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    transition: color 150ms ease;
  }

  .card:hover h3 { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .currently {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
